Local patch: decompress_pairs() reads the little-endian sizeTable entries through
from_le_u16(), as it already does for the other table fields. Without it, big-endian
hosts (PowerPC) decode wrong results whenever a lookup crosses a compressed block.

Local addition: tb_file_counts() (tbprobe.c/.h) returns the WDL and DTZ file counts
from the last tb_init(), for the engine's "info string Found ..." message.
